    <p>Deleting a project removes its drawings, components, toolpaths, history objects and refs, pull requests, workflow runs, mesh assets and operation logs. Version and comment rows cascade from their parent resource. A <code>CadOperationLog</code> row survives the deletion of its mesh asset with <code>meshAssetId</code> set to null. Toolpath links to materials, tools and machine configurations have no cascade, so a referenced material cannot be deleted while a toolpath points at it.</p>
